  "description": "Swift CVT Lite – The Perfect Mid-Drive Commuter eBike\nMake your daily commute easier, faster, and more enjoyable with the Swift CVT Lite, an entry-level mid-drive electric bike designed for city living. Whether you’re riding to work, running errands, or cruising on the weekend, this lightweight commuter eBike delivers comfort, efficiency, and style.\nKey Features\n\n250W Bafang M420 Mid-Drive Motor – Smooth, natural-feeling pedal assistance for effortless rides.\n\nEnviolo CVT Rear Hub – Shift seamlessly at any time with continuously variable transmission, giving you the perfect gear ratio on every ride.\n\n36V 14Ah (504Wh) Battery – Ride up to 75km on a single charge, perfect for commuting and day-to-day use.\n\nCustomizable Pedal Assist Levels – Choose the right level of support to match your riding style.\n\nTwo Frame Sizes – Designed to fit riders of different heights comfortably.\n\nFully Equipped for Commuting – Comes standard with a large color display, kickstand, rear rack, fenders, and integrated front and rear lights.\n\nBenefits for Commuters\n\nStress-Free Travel – Arrive at work fresh, without breaking a sweat.\n\nSmooth, Low-Maintenance Gearing – The Enviolo hub makes shifting simple and reliable in stop-and-go traffic.\n\nComfortable Daily Riding – Pedal assist and upright geometry reduce strain on longer rides.\n\nFits Your Lifestyle – Available in multiple colors and upgrade options to suit your needs.\n\nReady for City Living – Carry groceries, work bags, or essentials on the included rear rack.\n\nThe Swift CVT Lite is the smart choice for urban commuters looking for an affordable yet capable electric city bike. With its mid-drive motor, CVT gearing, and fully loaded commuter setup, it’s everything you need to transform your ride to work into the best part of your day.",
